│    _reasoning to check if that Msg contains "text" content blocks. │
│  • Only break and return if the Msg has "text" blocks.             │
│  • If the Msg only has "thinking" blocks and no "text" or          │
│    "tool_use" blocks, the loop should continue without breaking;   │
│  • This ensures the agent does not return an empty or              │
│    thinking-only response prematurely, and allows the model to     │
│    produce a visible response on subsequent iterations.            │
